Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:06.71,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(315,295)\fs29\fad(961,1038)}Six Months Earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:53.82,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,You're tougher than the rumors \Nsuggested, Red Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:13.17,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(315,295)\fs34\fad(506,515)\fsp6}And Today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.01,top,Reporter,0,0,0,,Watch this, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:18.77,top,Reporter,0,0,0,,I'm currently looking down on the battle \Nraging between the Gelato 5 and Gekko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:22.16,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Look at this! The action is \Ntoo intense to turn away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:26.16,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,These heroes are fighting \Nfor the peace of our world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:27.77,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.52,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Red Gelato and Reaper \NPrincess are facing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.62,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,It's a true battle between aces!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.99,sign_2195_10_Live_from_the_sk,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(564,20)}LIVE FROM THE SKIES ABOVE THE CITY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:34.99,main,Boy A&B,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:38.99,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,If you're watching this at home, \Nplease join me in cheering for Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:42.66,italics,Red,0,0,0,,I'll feint with a left hook, \Nleading into a right inside low kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:44.61,italics,Red,0,0,0,,Watch for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.23,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll block the low kick and \Nlead into a right high kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:49.00,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,You should duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:50.00,italics,Red,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:59.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Impressive indeed, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:02.01,main,Red,0,0,0,,Let's move this elsewhere, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:06.03,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Look at that! \NThey're heading off to have a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:10.52,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,For those who missed the previous episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.77,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4\an8}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:12.77,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,allow me to explain once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:16.72,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Red Gelato of Freezing Sentai \NGelato 5, Fudo Aikawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:23.03,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and combatant for Secret Society Gekko, \NReaper Princess, A.K.A. Desumi Magahara,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:28.00,sign_3430_28_They_are,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\move(530,5,515,10)\t(1,4870,\fs27)}T\NH\NE\NY\N \NA\NR\NE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:28.00,sign_3430_28_They_are,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\move(65,10,85,15)\t(1,4870,\fs27)}D\N\NA\N\NT\N\NI\N\NN\N\NG\N\N!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:26.42,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,are dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:01.97,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,303)\fscx95\fad(920,521)}Episode 2    {\fscx80}The Truth About Dating
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:02.01,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,By the way... Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What is it, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:06.82,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We seem a bit further away\Nthan usual, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,D-Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:11.01,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This feels normal to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:12.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's really not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.73,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We're usually much—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.19,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stay back! Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.04,sign_6127_39_Rejected,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(275,17)\frz24.52\fax-0.41\fad(1,575)}Rejected
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:18.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:23.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I just... I was really active today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:26.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm probably smelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.24,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(90,255)\fs15}Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.24,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:30.14,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,So, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:34.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I swear never to leave you, Desumi-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:35.73,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,no matter how you may smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:37.21,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't say it that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Why are you so insensitive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:42.35,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll just spend the rest of \Nthe day looking this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:55.56,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I've never known anyone so charming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.23,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I love you, even when you're angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:04.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:09.20,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stop it, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:19.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You can't share the pictures \Nif you use a camera like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Use my smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:27.84,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You have to scooch in more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\fad(1,40)\pos(452,202)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\pos(572,165)\fad(1,40)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.70,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,We-We're closer..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:34.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\fad(1,40)\pos(452,202)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:34.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\pos(572,165)\fad(1,40)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.00,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,We-We're so much closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\fad(1,40)\pos(452,202)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\pos(572,165)\fad(1,40)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:36.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\fad(1,40)\pos(452,202)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:36.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\pos(572,165)\fad(1,40)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:37.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\fad(1,40)\pos(452,202)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:37.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\pos(572,165)\fad(1,40)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.60,italics,both,0,0,0,,...than we've ever been!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:38.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\fad(1,40)\pos(452,202)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:38.33,sign_7981_60_tha_thump_tha_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.69\frz6.367\pos(572,165)\fad(1,40)}tha-thump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:41.61,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,The magic of the camera is a powerful thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:43.76,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:48.07,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Just as I thought... \NYou smell wonderful, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, eyes open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:52.11,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:57.21,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Hey, Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:58.90,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:02.21,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,We're finished up over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.21,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Did she see—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:06.09,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Hey, you beat Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:08.11,sign_8798_85_Death,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(425,90)\fad(93,386)\t(176,1170,\fsp6)}Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:08.11,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.01,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Great job, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.39,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.46,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We'd better get back fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.38,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:17.67,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,The TV station requested \Nan interview before we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:18.72,italics,Both,0,0,0,,Interview?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:22.79,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Red-san! Could I have an interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.94,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I'm here with some questions for Fudo Aikawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:35.70,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,high school student and \Never-reliable leader of Gelato 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.31,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,H-Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.54,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm Fudo Aikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:40.90,main,Boys A/B,0,0,0,,Red's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.96,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,It looks like you won your \Nduel with Reaper Princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:46.46,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,and kept the earth at peace once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I-Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:53.60,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I understand that Reaper Princess is an \Nextremely powerful and fearsome combatant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:57.85,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,How do you feel about her, Red-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.36,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,How do I feel about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:03.15,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:05.73,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,There's no one else like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:06.96,sign_10214_107_Blush,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(134,40)}Blush
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The day I first met her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.20,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,my heart was pounding so fast, \NI couldn't sleep that night!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:11.20,sign_10322_110_Bluuush,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,25)\fad(40,1)}Bluuush
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:14.49,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I sometimes spend an entire day \Nthinking of nothing but her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:20.63,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Did she move just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.67,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,J-Just your imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:25.02,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Just kill me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:28.53,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,So she's an indispensable \Nrival to fuel your own growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:32.80,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,and you approach every fight \Nwith great caution?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:38.31,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,You may be Mr. Stoic, Red-san, but you're \Nstill in the prime of your youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:41.81,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,So let's move to {\i1}that{\i0} question!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:43.31,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.28,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Do you have a girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:51.45,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,All the Red fans out there are {\i1}dying{\i0} to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.06,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:57.19,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I want to say I do, and that she's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:03.21,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Please! Fudo'd never have a girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:05.11,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Look at these muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:08.67,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Bodybuilding's all he \Nthinks about, morning 'til night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.46,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Aw, what a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:14.18,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,A lot of his female fans find that \Nsimplicity of his very charming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.71,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Even ones I know personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:18.51,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:25.61,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I guess it {\i1}would{\i0} do for you to learn \Na little bit about the feminine heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:29.68,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,So we're taking applications \Nfor a date with Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:31.57,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Look for details on the screen right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Please stop, Misaki-neesan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:35.13,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll try my luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:38.80,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Anyway, back to you guys in the studio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.65,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's safe now, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.53,sign_12769_138_sulk,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(110,100,90,50)\fad(212,247)}hrmph
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:56.80,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.35,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:08:59.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:01.86,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Though you do seem to be very popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:04.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun with the rapidly \Nexpanding female fanbase...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.51,0:09:06.48,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:08.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're the only girl for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.60,0:09:10.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:12.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:14.25,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I would do anything for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:17.45,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You would really do {\i1}anything{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:18.81,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Of course I would!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:24.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Then... would you take me out on a real date?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:36.92,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I felt so sure I'd never get a \Nchance to do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But I always wanted it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:47.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,To go with my sweetheart on a real... date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.16,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:54.58,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,A date is an event in which\Ntwo people choose a day of the week,]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:57.17,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,meet up, and get to know each other better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.71,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I can easily take you on a real date!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:01.61,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:02.27,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:05.15,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We'll meet up tomorrow at \Nfive o'clock in Central Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:14.05,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:18.10,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,What in the world do you do on a real date?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:34.69,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,T-Too many choices...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:38.34,sign_15213_168_Planetarium___Mo,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,537)}Planetarium\N\N Movie\N\N{\c&H7E61E0&} Meet up to go {\c&HFDFFFD&\3c&H7E61E0&\blur2\bord1}shopping{red}\N\N{\bord2\blur0\c&H100D12&\3c&HFCFFFC&} Things to {\c&H4013DB&}enjoy {\c&H0A0E10&}as a couple!\N\N{\c&HAF2A41&}Dating {\c&HCD47BF&}recs\N\N{\c&HB31225&} Recommended spots
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:38.34,sign_15213_168_Planetarium___Mo,sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H606BAE&\fad(1,537)}T{\c&H7A18C3&}h{\c&H606BAE&}e{\c&H7A18C3&}m{\c&H606BAE&}e {\c&H7A18C3&}P{\c&H606BAE&}a{\c&H7A18C3&}r{\c&H606BAE&}k\N\N{\c&H618CDD&\3c&H000000&\bord1\blur2} Dinner\N\N{\c&H0A090E&\3c&H9361E5&} Classy Spots For Cultured Adults\N\N{\c&HC87C41&\3c&HFDFFFD&\blur0} Aquarium\N\N{\c&H4EF24B&\3c&H387889&\blur2} Drive\N\N{\c&H3DC5E5&\blur0\3c&HFEFEFE&} Zoo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:36.59,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:37.97,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:41.82,sign_15293_171_Date_Plan,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(537,1)}Date Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:42.79,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It will be tomorrow before \NI settle on anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:48.41,sign_15427_172_The_Latest_Datin,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(155,20)}The Latest Dating Spots
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:50.72,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Whatcha up to, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:56.30,sign_15589_174_Beer,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,20)}BEER
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.27,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Lookin' up more muscle stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Misaki-neesan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.30,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You smell like beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.80,sign_15427_172_The_Latest_Datin,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\3c&HF9F6EB&\fs11}Popular Places for Love!\N{\c&H4B31D2&}Learn About All the Trends!\N {\c&H671AAF&}The Latest Dating Spots
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:58.80,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:00.27,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Wouldja look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:04.03,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's because I said that thing on \NTV about takin' dating applications!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:06.32,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,So now you're doin' homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:08.00,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well... something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:12.05,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But I can't figure out what \Nan ideal date would look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.05,0:11:13.79,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Look at you, all serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:15.94,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,There aren't really any rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:20.20,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,All that matters is you pick \Nout something you both enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:24.20,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I... I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:28.45,sign_15293_171_Date_Plan,Sign,0,0,0,,Date Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:28.45,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,In that instant, the seemingly insurmountable\N wall in my mind began to crumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.23,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I had arrived at the truth about dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:55.44,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:58.57,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,The civilians around me \Ndon't seem to have noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:00.77,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,My disguise is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:03.62,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,No one will interrupt our precious date!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.45,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It should be about time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:11.28,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,But now that it comes down to it...\N I do find myself nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:13.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:17.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, did I keep you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:19.65,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs34\fad(1,590)}squee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:22.84,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi's in plain clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:25.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Something about meeting up formally like this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:27.25,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,makes me feel a little self-conscious...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:29.31,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Is she capable of doing \Nanything that isn't precious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:31.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's quite the disguise, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:34.46,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Actually, other than the \Nglasses and the hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.39,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,it's all my usual style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:38.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,R-Really? It suits you, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:41.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,So, what will we be doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.57,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No need to worry there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:46.82,sign_18284_212_Today_s_Date,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,20)}Today's Date
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:44.83,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I've worked it all out in advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:46.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A date plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:49.02,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's begin, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:49.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:58.90,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Here! This is where we'll start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.22,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:06.64,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The Gotanda branch of that historic \Ntraining gym, Kin-niku Gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:10.38,main,man,0,0,0,,Would you look at those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:12.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well done, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:13.56,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're really hitting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:16.80,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Go on! Blast those triceps!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:20.27,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Reach for those glimmering trapezius muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:23.28,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Play through the pain to \Nbuild those adductors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.82,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Next up, running!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:26.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Running?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:33.75,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Something Desumi-san and I can both enjoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:35.62,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Training, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:39.26,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I didn't know it could be this fun
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:41.59,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,to do things I normally do \Non my own with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.27,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Dating is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:52.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:55.32,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Are you starting to get hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.02,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's have a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:13:59.90,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:03.53,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And there's something I'd really \Nlike to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.90,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What could it be? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:09.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Here, this one's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.66,sign_20378_241_Protein_Bar,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-14.4\pos(289,120)\fad(523,1)}Protein Bar
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.66,sign_20378_241_Protein_Bar,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-14.4\fs8\pos(188,130)\fad(523,1)}Low Sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:15.04,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And there's plenty more where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:19.54,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Now, as for what I wanted to discuss...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:24.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san, which insect do you think \Nwould be strongest if it was a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:24.87,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I think—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:26.24,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I need to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:33.65,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes! Nice work, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:35.51,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's all gone perfectly so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:37.57,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,After this, it's the main event!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:39.35,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,The human anatomy exhibit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.81,sign_21053_252_Human_Anatomy_Ex,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(315,25)\fscy150}Human Anatomy Exhibit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.81,sign_21053_252_Human_Anatomy_Ex,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\pos(315,220)\fs10}Tokyo Hero Museum of Art
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.80,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,She's just going to love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:48.86,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Oh, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:51.49,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Misaki-neesan? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:55.38,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's about that advice \NI gave you yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.08,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Just forget all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:57.95,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:15:03.38,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I was pretty drunk, and I think I \Ntold you there weren't any rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:05.46,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I guess there kind of are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:07.85,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,C-Could you tell me what they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.26,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,For... future reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.09,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,The first one's about your appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:15.29,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm betting you'll want to go \Nin a tight-fitting tank top,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:16.97,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,but don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:18.85,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Make yourself presentable, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:22.16,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,And since the girl will probably \Nbe dressing up a bit herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:25.36,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,avoid any activities that might \Nmake her sweat or get dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:29.36,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,And be sure to get reservations \Nat a halfway decent restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:32.63,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I'll bet you didn't need \Nme to tell you that stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:37.70,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,After that, stick to talk of sweets \Nor something, and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:42.96,sign_22473_273__Which_insect_do,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,10}"Which insect\N do you\Nthink would\N be strongest\N if it was\N a giant?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:41.99,flashback italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Which insect do you think would \Nbe strongest if it was a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:45.25,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well, that's all! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:55.30,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:59.22,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,This wasn't a real date at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.72,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's no wonder she hasn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:13.76,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.66,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Next time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:22.32,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I promise to create a date \Nplan that you'll enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.09,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,So, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:34.41,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Please, give me one more chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:55.90,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:16:59.53,sign_24434_285_shiver,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HA1A54F&\fad(1,100)}freeze
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:16:59.55,sign_24434_285_shiver,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(270,20)}shiver
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:03.20,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:04.70,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:06.44,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You came back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I went to buy drinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:13.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,but the store was crowded, \Nso I got stuck there a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You know how...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:21.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,these things make your mouth dry\Nunless you have something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:24.39,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I eat them sometimes myself, so I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:28.90,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now, what were you saying \Nabout the strongest insect?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:30.55,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:32.11,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What's impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:35.69,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Are you saying... you were \Nactually enjoying this date?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.24,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What's with you, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:40.49,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You've been acting a little \Nweird for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:43.43,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,W-Well... see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.73,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Y-You aren't angry, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:51.43,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:54.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But it's nice to know that you \Nworry about these things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:56.23,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:18:02.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm just happy knowing you made \Nup that whole plan for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:06.49,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm content just being out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:09.62,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,The world might think \Nit's weird, but who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.52,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We are who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:16.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's go easy on ourselves, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:23.21,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:30.46,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Just like it was that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:35.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:50.90,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,What is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:55.33,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,this all-new feeling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:03.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I-It's a call!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.24,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Yeah, looks like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:08.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well, I should be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:09.84,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.25,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:19.26,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Wretched heroes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:21.55,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I'm here for payback!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.80,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Too bad you'll just get more of the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:25.22,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:28.87,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Hey, Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.17,main,Blue,0,0,0,,We're fighting, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:34.29,sign_10214_107_Blush,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\pos(235,20)\c&HC080E5&\3c&HAD61B0&\fad(673,701)}bliss
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:31.75,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.29,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Reaper Princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:10.74,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(553,230)\fs15\bord3\fad(255,1)}This is the Gekko\Nwomen's dorm\N (pets allowed)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:10.74,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,This is the Gekko women's dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.13,0:21:17.75,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Many of the female staffers who work \Nfor Secret Society Gekko live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:20.75,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,My name is Hellko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.97,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,Were you a good girl while I was gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:24.03,sign_30718_334_hugs,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(75,60)\fad(500,500)}hugs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:27.26,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,I am the precious little kitty of \NReaper Princess, A.K.A. Desumi Magahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:33.02,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,I'm told that there are many who tremble \Nat the sound of my mistress's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:36.11,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,but I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.52,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,When she's at home...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:40.52,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Is this a good color on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:43.86,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,...she just seems like any other girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:47.61,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,She's sensitive, awkward, and \Ninclined toward loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.12,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Just your average everyday girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:56.25,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What do you think it's like to be in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:59.35,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I guess I'll never know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:09.76,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,At work, they started a rumor that \Nmy favorite food is raw bear meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:13.22,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,How could someone like me ever know love?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.31,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Then, one night...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.89,0:22:20.02,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,My mistress came back in a daze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:18.66,sign_32067_349_sway,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(435,60)\fad(251,323)}sway
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:20.37,sign_32067_349_sway,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(251,323)\pos(265,20)}sway
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:23.69,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,I was terribly worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:25.78,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:30.55,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Ever since then, she's been \Nlaughing and smiling so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:32.71,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,It's as if she's under a magic spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:35.92,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Today they told me I was \Nthe incarnation of an ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:37.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Isn't that a silly thing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:40.11,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,A single match can start a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:43.29,sign_32627_359_Red_Saves_the_Da,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz5.98\fax0.43\move(123,75,145,75)}Red Saves the Day!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:45.80,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Which should I go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:48.55,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,She does appear happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:50.62,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well, you watch the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:54.31,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,And she somehow seems prettier than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:55.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.64,0:23:00.47,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,What could have happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:05.07,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.69,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,I know exactly what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:11.57,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Listen to me, you goon of a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:15.08,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,If you ever do anything \Nto make my mistress sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.34,0:23:17.14,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,I'll see that you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:23.50,italics,Gelato,0,0,0,,Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:25.91,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Fudo is going to infiltrate \NGekko's fortress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:28.67,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,We head to the amusement \Npark after Fudo-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:29.55,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,But there, we see...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.55,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Pathetic humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:34.35,top,Culverin,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the true meaning of fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(503,1)}Episode 3     {\fscx98}At Last, the Amusement Park
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.45,0:23:34.35,sign_33889_377_smack,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(550,45,560,20)\fad(1,188)}smack
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.35,0:23:37.39,italicstop,all,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination, Episode 3:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:39.18,italicstop,all,0,0,0,,"At Last, the Amusement Park"!
